emetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l001","ordinal":234440,"en":"I grieved against it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l002","ordinal":234441,"en":"He was sitting down"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l003","ordinal":234442,"en":"Kalyk and Baitailak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l004","ordinal":234443,"en":"I lost these two."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l005","ordinal":234444,"en":"Kamin, my father, Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l006","ordinal":234445,"en":"Blankets on the surface"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l007","ordinal":234446,"en":"It's going to come out."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l008","ordinal":234447,"en":"On the outskirts of Kambyl Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l009","ordinal":234448,"en":"Berenderi page,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l010","ordinal":234449,"en":"On the edge of the well-known Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l011","ordinal":234450,"en":"The dug hole will come,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l012","ordinal":234451,"en":"Boiling sorrow comes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l013","ordinal":234452,"en":"I want to cover it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l014","ordinal":234453,"en":"See the grass on the ground,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l015","ordinal":234454,"en":"See a lot of Chinese herbs."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l016","ordinal":234455,"en":"See the ant worm,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l017","ordinal":234456,"en":"Ошол курттай кытай журтту көр."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l018","ordinal":234457,"en":"The ground is disturbed, the grass grows,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l019","ordinal":234458,"en":"It is coming out."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l020","ordinal":234459,"en":"Don't worry"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l021","ordinal":234460,"en":"He is driving."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l022","ordinal":234461,"en":"Oljolodu Buuruldu,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l023","ordinal":234462,"en":"It was terrible, Shaymbet."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l024","ordinal":234463,"en":"There is no such hero in the country,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l025","ordinal":234464,"en":"Slowed everything down"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l026","ordinal":234465,"en":"There is no unbeliever like Konurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l027","ordinal":234466,"en":"Measure it, man"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l028","ordinal":234467,"en":"I did not die."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l029","ordinal":234468,"en":"Shooting a bow and arrow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l030","ordinal":234469,"en":"I gave a lot of effort,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l031","ordinal":234470,"en":"My head was full of blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l032","ordinal":234471,"en":"That's all I've finished"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l033","ordinal":234472,"en":"It happened without blinking."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l034","ordinal":234473,"en":"I saw the face of China,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l035","ordinal":234474,"en":"It smoked every time it ran out"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l036","ordinal":234475,"en":"It is a native Chinese people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l037","ordinal":234476,"en":"It grows every time it dies,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l038","ordinal":234477,"en":"Stubborn Chinese people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l039","ordinal":234478,"en":"If I mix,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l001","ordinal":234479,"en":"There is an albanian variety."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l002","ordinal":234480,"en":"Separated from the person"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l003","ordinal":234481,"en":"Eren Kalcha Karkybar,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l004","ordinal":234482,"en":"There is hair and blood."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l005","ordinal":234483,"en":"From a man of the naked variety"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l006","ordinal":234484,"en":"Everything you need is there."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l007","ordinal":234485,"en":"He is insatiable with blood if caught."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l008","ordinal":234486,"en":"He did not spare his life."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l009","ordinal":234487,"en":"A confused soul"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l010","ordinal":234488,"en":"Now he thought he was dead."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l011","ordinal":234489,"en":"His ears heard and his eyes saw"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l012","ordinal":234490,"en":"I didn't have this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l013","ordinal":234491,"en":"When a cat sees a cat, it eats it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l014","ordinal":234492,"en":"If you see a snail, catch it and eat it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l015","ordinal":234493,"en":"If you see it, chase it and eat it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l016","ordinal":234494,"en":"A goat picks and eats"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l017","ordinal":234495,"en":"I saw such a mad crowd,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0625:b003:l018","ordinal":234496,"en":"But I have no escape,"}]
